{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CfRaYk9VKiV6NaQMUiXkJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Item 04 is done. Everything the driver needs is in place, and nothing else remains to request.\n\n**Verdict: the optimum concentrates, and the kill is not met.** At n = 40 every one of the 36 cells has a coefficient of variation under 0.2 (max 0.197, median 0.031). The 32 cells above 0.2 at smaller sizes are all Bernoulli cells at or below the giant-component threshold, where the optimum is a small integer with a flat standard deviation near 0.8. Above the threshold the spread is at most one stack at n ≤ 40, but a cell still spans two or three adjacent values.\n\n**The formula, labelled not a bound.** The mean optimum is linear in n above the threshold (r² ≥ 0.999 in all 17 fixed-degree series) with a slope that depends on the nominal degree D alone. The form that captures it is `E[opt] ≈ 2.1(1−q) + n·[1 − √(1−q)·27/(D+27)]` with q the random-intersection edge probability and D = (n−1)q. Held-out MAE is 0.49 stacks on cell means and 0.80 per instance, sitting below the optimum on 9,445 instances and above on 10,641. The enumerated monomial search cannot express the saturating shape and loses to a plain linear baseline, which the report says outright.\n\n**Two findings that revise earlier sections.** λ in the sandwich is not ½: pooled it matches §5 to the digit, but by density it runs monotonically from 0 to ⅔, so §5's midpoint was an average over sparsities. Pathwidth exceeds treewidth certifiably on about a tenth of instances at n ≥ 25, never by more than 2, concentrated at 2–2.5 customers per product, and the min-fill heuristic's own growing slack hides how that gap scales.\n\n**Deliverables.** `learning/concentration.py`, `tests/test_concentration.py` (7 tests, full suite 798 passed), report §12 in `reports/ml_nature.md`, full tables in `reports/concentration_tables.md` plus a per-class variant, and `reports/figures/concentration.png`. PROGRESS.md carries the iteration entry with notes for items 05 and 06, and iterations.md marks item 04 done. Nothing was written to `solutions/`, no solver default changed, nothing committed."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2948,"cache_read_input_tokens":211837,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2948,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":760,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c7f6ac10-5cdb-425b-85a9-2cf007661e3c","uuid":"6f163de6-7956-4055-b07a-520bbec1eb8a","timestamp":"2026-09-26T06:29:48.467Z","request_id":"req_011CfRaYicTtTi2srASLhNsc"}
